23
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:01,120
The output is a professional daily morning digest containing derived summaries and mandatory

24
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:07,360
source links delivered seamlessly. Finally, the platform displays a high-resolution vector blueprint

25
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:11,600
outlining the full system architecture. In the progress tracker section,

26
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:17,920
students and instructors can monitor study duration, interactive click counts, flashcard reviews,

27
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:23,360
